{
 "version": 1,
 "description": "Declared mutants of the voxel_map Module (docs/architecture/target/v2/voxel-map.zh-Hant.md; big-map declaration section 12, v8-arch-gyo2-big-map-s1). vmap- the index, vreg- a region, vchunk- a chunk, vexp- the expansion, vload- the loaders, vlink- the links. One per independently wrong decision of VM-1 to VM-7 (tests/common/mutation/README.md, criteria 1 to 3 and 9). Not added (with the reason): rule M1's exact fields, M7's six faces and C2's seven integers (Json shape checks of one helper each, ExactObject and Integers, whose removal reads members that are not there); R2's version and M2's schema kind (the same comparison as the schema mutants, criterion 1); the division by 16 (exact, so a multiplication by 1/16 is an equivalent mutant). Retired in S1: vmap-file-leading-slash (a leading / makes an empty first segment, so the empty-segment rule already refuses it; the separate check was removed, vmap-file-empty-segment guards it).",
